Many small shops in Japan are still cash-only. Ask this first 💳
Ask before you reach the register.

Today's phrases:
• カードは つかえますか (kaado wa tsukaemasu ka) = Can I use a card?
• げんきん (genkin) = Cash
• だいじょうぶです (daijoubu desu) = It's okay

